{"availability":"available","full":"975L/SiteBundle","name":"SiteBundle","description":"Symfony bundle that turns the c975L core into a complete website — full layout, database-driven pages, navbar and footer menus, collections, branded emails, per-page SEO and health check.","category":"Developer tools","language":"PHP","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2018-03-02T17:25:12Z","updated":"2026-10-09T09:35:19Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://975l.com/en/pages/site-bundle","topics":["legal-notice","legal-texts","symfony","symfony-bundle","website"],"demo":"https://bundles.975l.com/demo/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T11:00:18.882Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T11:00:18.882Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T11:00:18.882Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T11:00:18.882Z","discoveredVia":[],"metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T11:00:18.882Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Symfony bundle that turns the c975L core into a complete website — full layout, database-driven pages, navbar and footer menus, collections, branded emails, per-page SEO and health check.","Bundle page · Tutorials · Block kinds · Live demo · Demo back-office","Add SiteBundle on top of c975L/CoreBundle (ConfigBundle + UiBundle, one package) and get a complete website — pages, menus, SEO, EasyAdmin back office. Need a book catalog, an online shop, a photo gallery? Add BookBundle, ShopBundle, GalleryBundle: they rest on the same foundation, alongside SiteBundle, never on top of it."],"features":["Base layout with SEO-optimized meta tags (OpenGraph, robots, canonical, favicon, Apple touch icon)","Page display from Twig templates (file-based) or from the database via the Page entity","Template-based page redirects and 410 Gone handling (database redirects are ConfigBundle's, see its own readme)","Admin CRUD for database pages via EasyAdmin","Admin CRUD for the site's navbar/footer menus and the email header/footer via EasyAdmin"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/975L/SiteBundle/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"4acadccffd23e692ba0b2f8ce5613955394e6242f65f7dbc0eddec07305c9e84","extractedAt":"2026-10-09T11:00:18.882Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T11:00:18.882Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Symfony bundle that turns the c975L core into a complete website — full layout, database-driven pages, navbar and footer menus, collections, branded emails, per-page SEO and health check.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/975L/SiteBundle/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"c975l:scaffold:install puts templates/layout.html.twig in your project for you — it is shipped by c975L/ConfigBundle, so that the login and reset-password pages it also scaffolds have a shell whether or not this bundle sits on top:","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/975L/SiteBundle/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Members only: a page kept for signed-in visitors sends an anonymous one to the login form (PageController::gate(), the firewall's entry point answering the AccessDeniedException) — so does a collection item rendered through such a detail page.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/975L/SiteBundle/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"paid_service","status":"required","text":"If you need an itemized audit trail for an accessibility declaration (RGAA 4.1's 106 criteria map to WCAG 2.1 AA, EAA enforceable since June 2025), run WAVE's own browser extension manually per page, or reintroduce a paid provider on your own HealthCheckProviderInterface implementation.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/975L/SiteBundle/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"4acadccffd23e692ba0b2f8ce5613955394e6242f65f7dbc0eddec07305c9e84","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/975L/SiteBundle/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T11:00:18.882Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-09T09:35:19Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"sav